{"root":{"data":{"id":"dky5ieg2t6o0","created":1787673904829,"text":"卡牌"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5isxf65c0","created":1787673936352,"text":"角色卡"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dky5itmvknc0","created":1787673937891,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dky5iyb7muo0","created":1787673948070,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l71e80","created":1787674277368,"text":"道具卡","layout_right_offset":{"x":19,"y":-411}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7vug0","created":1787674277369,"text":"抽奖机","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7js80","created":1787674277369,"text":"玩家个人抽奖机，比如骰子，抽签，可以抽出魔卡"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7m9s0","created":1787674277369,"text":"死亡笔记"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l80a80","created":1787674277369,"text":"5秒钟后死亡"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7vjc0","created":1787674277369,"text":"生死簿"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7n8g0","created":1787674277369,"text":"开启地府 地图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7v1c0","created":1787674277369,"text":"对于不是中国元素战斗角色，只会扣除30%血量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7zug0","created":1787674277369,"text":"迪迦召唤器"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7xr40","created":1787674277369,"text":"美杜莎眼睛"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7pvs0","created":1787674277369,"text":"cd"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7iqg0","created":1787674277369,"text":"石化敌人，然后打死敌人"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7w7k0","created":1787674277369,"text":"贞子的录像带"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7vwo0","created":1787674277369,"text":"永久"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7zvs0","created":1787674277369,"text":"赠送敌人录像带，七天后敌人死亡（玩家获取时候不会显示“贞子”，玩家死亡后，给予提示）"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7iaw0","created":1787674277369,"text":"和平星、七龙珠、"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l7rj40","created":1787674277369,"text":"给予30张随机卡牌"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dky5n5l81og0","created":1787674277369,"text":"变出花田魔法"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-green-compat","version":"1.4.43"}